          "html": "<h1 class=\"flm-pres-block--heading\" id=\"sec-intro\" data-flm-heading=\"section\" data-flm-level=\"1\" data-flm-toc=\"true\">Introduction</h1>\n<p class=\"flm-pres-par\">This document exercises every standard feature of build step 1: headings, paragraphs, the base formatting commands, math, user definitions and references. It is version 1.0.</p>\n<h2 class=\"flm-pres-block--heading\" id=\"sec-fmt\" data-flm-heading=\"subsection\" data-flm-level=\"2\" data-flm-toc=\"true\">Formatting</h2>\n<p class=\"flm-pres-par\">Some <em class=\"flm-pres-span\" data-flm-style=\"emph\">emphasized</em>, <strong class=\"flm-pres-span\" data-flm-style=\"bold\">bold</strong>, <i class=\"flm-pres-span\" data-flm-style=\"italic\">italic</i> and <code class=\"flm-pres-span\" data-flm-style=\"monospace\">monospace</code> text — with a dash, an ellipsis… and “quotes” resolved by typography.</p>\n<h3 class=\"flm-pres-block--heading\" id=\"sec--Math\" data-flm-heading=\"subsubsection\" data-flm-level=\"3\" data-flm-toc=\"true\">Math</h3>\n<p class=\"flm-pres-par\">Inline math <span class=\"flm-pres-math--passthrough\" data-flm-display=\"inline\">\\(x_1 + \\alpha\\)</span> and display math \n  <span class=\"flm-pres-math--passthrough\" data-flm-display=\"display\">\\[ \\int_0^1 f(x)\\,dx = 1 \\]</span> then two environments:\n</p>\n<span class=\"flm-pres-math--passthrough\" data-flm-display=\"display\" data-flm-env=\"equation\">\\begin{equation}<tex-html><span class=\"flm-pres-math--text\" id=\"eq--1opqm\"></span></tex-html>\n  E = mc^2\\tag*{$<tex-html><span class=\"flm-pres-math--text\">(1)</span></tex-html>$}\n\\end{equation}</span>\n<span class=\"flm-pres-math--passthrough\" data-flm-display=\"display\" data-flm-env=\"align*\">\\begin{align*}<tex-html><span class=\"flm-pres-math--text\" id=\"eq--2oqua\"></span></tex-html>\n  a &amp;= b \\\\<tex-html><span class=\"flm-pres-math--text\" id=\"eq--3oqke\"></span></tex-html>\n  c &amp;= d\n\\end{align*}</span>\n<h3 class=\"flm-pres-block--heading\" id=\"sec--Verbatim\" data-flm-heading=\"subsubsection\" data-flm-level=\"3\" data-flm-toc=\"true\">Verbatim</h3>\n<p class=\"flm-pres-par\">Inline <code class=\"flm-pres-verbatim\" data-flm-kind=\"text\" data-flm-display=\"inline\">a{b}\\c</code> text, the code <code class=\"flm-pres-verbatim\" data-flm-kind=\"code\" data-flm-display=\"inline\" data-flm-lang=\"python\">f(x) = 1</code> and the identifier <code class=\"flm-pres-verbatim\" data-flm-kind=\"a\" data-flm-display=\"inline\" data-flm-lang=\"rust\">struct</code>, then <code class=\"flm-pres-verbatim\" data-flm-kind=\"text\" data-flm-display=\"inline\">raw {text}</code> in the same paragraph, and a code block:</p>\n<pre class=\"flm-pres-verbatim\" data-flm-kind=\"code\" data-flm-display=\"block\" data-flm-lang=\"python\"><code>def f(x):\n    return {x} + 1\n</code></pre>\n<h4 class=\"flm-pres-block--heading\" id=\"sec--Definitions\" data-flm-heading=\"paragraph\" data-flm-level=\"4\" data-flm-toc=\"true\">Definitions</h4>\n<p class=\"flm-pres-par\">Hello, World! from a user macro, and [Note: a user environment] in the same paragraph.</p>\n<h5 class=\"flm-pres-block--heading\" id=\"sec--References\" data-flm-heading=\"subparagraph\" data-flm-level=\"5\" data-flm-toc=\"true\">References</h5>\n<p class=\"flm-pres-par\">See <a class=\"flm-pres-link\" href=\"#sec-intro\" data-flm-kind=\"ref\">Introduction</a>, <a class=\"flm-pres-link\" href=\"#sec-fmt\" data-flm-kind=\"ref\">Formatting</a> and <span class=\"flm-pres-span\" data-flm-style=\"unresolved-reference\">sec:missing</span>.</p>\n<h1 class=\"flm-pres-block--heading\" id=\"sec--Unnumbered\" data-flm-heading=\"section\" data-flm-level=\"1\" data-flm-toc=\"true\">Unnumbered</h1>\n<p class=\"flm-pres-par\">A starred heading takes no number and stays in the contents.</p>"
